   IT IS A WITNESS AND NOT THE RECORD: extracted/, a snapshot, and dated.

2b A FINDING ABOUT THE RULING ITSELF
   object titles that collide across families     1
        family L    Three excluded forms
        family T    The three excluded forms
   Within a family every title is distinct.  Across families exactly one pair
   is not, and it is an article apart.  IF A HANDLE IS REPLACED BY A
   DESCRIPTIVE TITLE, A TITLE MUST IDENTIFY ITS OBJECT -- so these two need
   their family, or one needs renaming.  That is M's, and it is named here.

